{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "08edb2a394857045fa087b1a4fa7129ffd745fbe0249c6066a3a218718f4e0d7", "chunk_id": "tenant-a/coupon_compensation_policy.md:chunk:0:0", "doc_id": "tenant-a/coupon_compensation_policy.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-a/coupon_compensation_policy.md:section:0", "section_path": ["Tenant A 优惠券与补偿边界", "可用场景"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-a/coupon_compensation_policy.md", "tags": ["complaint", "delivery", "handoff", "manual", "sop"], "tenant_id": "tenant-a", "text": "优惠券补偿适用于物流延迟、售后等待时间较长、轻微服务体验问题。 普通坐席可建议补偿，但金额、类型和有效期需要系统规则或主管审批。", "title": "可用场景"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "04025e001e3d860857f4f49c84745cb1f37485b484ded865dd6f9cfc0a6ad779", "chunk_id": "tenant-a/coupon_compensation_policy.md:chunk:1:0", "doc_id": "tenant-a/coupon_compensation_policy.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-a/coupon_compensation_policy.md:section:1", "section_path": ["Tenant A 优惠券与补偿边界", "不可承诺"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-a/coupon_compensation_policy.md", "tags": ["complaint", "delivery", "handoff", "manual", "sop"], "tenant_id": "tenant-a", "text": "客户提出精神损失费、误工费、惩罚性赔偿时，坐席不得承诺现金赔偿。 涉及法律威胁、监管投诉或媒体曝光时，必须转人工主管。", "title": "不可承诺"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "8f7fd66f9fd500b3c7627a03b62f3edb13d885d574c5146830a54e4e92379722", "chunk_id": "tenant-a/coupon_compensation_policy.md:chunk:2:0", "doc_id": "tenant-a/coupon_compensation_policy.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-a/coupon_compensation_policy.md:section:2", "section_path": ["Tenant A 优惠券与补偿边界", "记录要求"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-a/coupon_compensation_policy.md", "tags": ["complaint", "delivery", "handoff", "manual", "sop"], "tenant_id": "tenant-a", "text": "每次补偿建议都需要记录触发原因、订单号、客户诉求和对应 SOP。 重复补偿、同一客户短期多次投诉、金额异常时，系统应提示风险。", "title": "记录要求"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "044ed424541b571baefda32bbe98158fc1371f3d3a9c9d8ad5c2e8569c732ac2", "chunk_id": "tenant-a/delivery_delay_sop.md:chunk:0:0", "doc_id": "tenant-a/delivery_delay_sop.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-a/delivery_delay_sop.md:section:0", "section_path": ["Tenant A 物流延迟处理 SOP", "延迟判定"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-a/delivery_delay_sop.md", "tags": ["complaint", "delivery", "handoff", "manual", "sop"], "tenant_id": "tenant-a", "text": "物流超过承诺时间 48 小时仍未更新，或包裹连续 3 天停留在同一分拨中心，可判定为物流异常。 坐席应先查询物流轨迹、承运商状态和订单发货时间，再判断是否需要升级。", "title": "延迟判定"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "b641629716886ca9c93ce0421779c9e373f48af3b0d2922a2bd9265fdd5f07db", "chunk_id": "tenant-a/delivery_delay_sop.md:chunk:1:0", "doc_id": "tenant-a/delivery_delay_sop.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-a/delivery_delay_sop.md:section:1", "section_path": ["Tenant A 物流延迟处理 SOP", "坐席步骤"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-a/delivery_delay_sop.md", "tags": ["complaint", "delivery", "handoff", "manual", "sop"], "tenant_id": "tenant-a", "text": "第一步安抚客户并确认收货地址。 第二步查询承运商轨迹，记录最近一次扫描时间。 第三步根据延迟时长给出处理方案：48 小时内继续关注，超过 48 小时可申请物流催查，超过 5 天可升级主管评估补偿。", "title": "坐席步骤"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "fd18dc2f38c62f6b8616af4054af794d2917fc56eca3ee32ac7c3349d62762b6", "chunk_id": "tenant-a/delivery_delay_sop.md:chunk:2:0", "doc_id": "tenant-a/delivery_delay_sop.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-a/delivery_delay_sop.md:section:2", "section_path": ["Tenant A 物流延迟处理 SOP", "补偿边界"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-a/delivery_delay_sop.md", "tags": ["complaint", "delivery", "handoff", "manual", "sop"], "tenant_id": "tenant-a", "text": "坐席可说明“可能发放优惠券或运费补偿”，但不得直接承诺金额。 高价值订单、投诉倾向、媒体曝光或法律威胁必须转人工主管处理。", "title": "补偿边界"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "12a21751dfe95ceffeb22262f3f47d4aeec311f723973048a675588238aef609", "chunk_id": "tenant-a/exchange_policy.md:chunk:0:0", "doc_id": "tenant-a/exchange_policy.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-a/exchange_policy.md:section:0", "section_path": ["Tenant A 换货与型号错误处理", "换货入口"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-a/exchange_policy.md", "tags": ["handoff", "manual", "refund"], "tenant_id": "tenant-a", "text": "客户收到错误型号、颜色或规格不符时，坐席应先核对订单 SKU、仓库出库记录和商品序列号。 若确认平台发错货，7 天内优先安排免费换货；若客户自行选错型号，应按普通退货规则处理。", "title": "换货入口"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "975116dd270d6ddb1613ef10bfba98e244d2c0b019c09bcd9fd8628755b1db6d", "chunk_id": "tenant-a/exchange_policy.md:chunk:1:0", "doc_id": "tenant-a/exchange_policy.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-a/exchange_policy.md:section:1", "section_path": ["Tenant A 换货与型号错误处理", "库存与差价"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-a/exchange_policy.md", "tags": ["handoff", "manual", "refund"], "tenant_id": "tenant-a", "text": "同价同型号换货无需补差价。 若客户希望更换为更高价格型号，必须先退后买，不能由坐席私下改价。 若目标型号缺货，坐席可提供退款、等待补货或升级主管三种选项。", "title": "库存与差价"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "7bdada392f4f032a813013be9c463d72b8c1036d1006fda753b3737167061923", "chunk_id": "tenant-a/exchange_policy.md:chunk:2:0", "doc_id": "tenant-a/exchange_policy.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-a/exchange_policy.md:section:2", "section_path": ["Tenant A 换货与型号错误处理", "风险控制"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-a/exchange_policy.md", "tags": ["handoff", "manual", "refund"], "tenant_id": "tenant-a", "text": "换货前必须确认原商品未人为损坏，配件和赠品齐全。 客户已经拆封但主张型号错误时，需要上传外包装条码和商品实拍。 无法核实的场景不得直接承诺换货。", "title": "风险控制"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "8b3b7ac8e6cebbde8617a7ccee5a463c3d4770dbfd7336665fa9b93197d20e74", "chunk_id": "tenant-a/invoice_policy.md:chunk:0:0", "doc_id": "tenant-a/invoice_policy.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-a/invoice_policy.md:section:0", "section_path": ["Tenant A 发票与抬头规则", "开票规则"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-a/invoice_policy.md", "tags": ["billing", "manual"], "tenant_id": "tenant-a", "text": "客户可在订单完成后 30 天内申请电子普通发票。 企业抬头必须提供准确公司名称和纳税人识别号，个人抬头无需税号。 发票金额以实际支付金额为准，不包含优惠券抵扣部分。", "title": "开票规则"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "420b837082fec02534482e9c3660d53f0a9c3d86437810f7c4a35be0d980f2ce", "chunk_id": "tenant-a/invoice_policy.md:chunk:1:0", "doc_id": "tenant-a/invoice_policy.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-a/invoice_policy.md:section:1", "section_path": ["Tenant A 发票与抬头规则", "修改与红冲"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-a/invoice_policy.md", "tags": ["billing", "manual"], "tenant_id": "tenant-a", "text": "发票已开具但抬头错误时，坐席应先核实错误原因。 未入账发票可申请红冲重开；已入账发票需要客户确认财务处理状态。 跨月红冲可能延长处理时间。", "title": "修改与红冲"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "510bcf37660a68091d94044214802e27d7a293050bdaf0468cdd26eb3832520a", "chunk_id": "tenant-a/invoice_policy.md:chunk:2:0", "doc_id": "tenant-a/invoice_policy.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-a/invoice_policy.md:section:2", "section_path": ["Tenant A 发票与抬头规则", "边界"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-a/invoice_policy.md", "tags": ["billing", "manual"], "tenant_id": "tenant-a", "text": "坐席不得承诺虚开发票、拆分金额、修改商品名称或开具未实际支付金额。 客户要求违规开票时，应说明平台合规要求并拒绝。", "title": "边界"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "7d32473a50f1cfde5b52eb4de5dcf9ae02d5f393be9d9142d6a60f44fbd0f6eb", "chunk_id": "tenant-a/lost_package_sop.md:chunk:0:0", "doc_id": "tenant-a/lost_package_sop.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-a/lost_package_sop.md:section:0", "section_path": ["Tenant A 丢件与签收争议 SOP", "争议类型"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-a/lost_package_sop.md", "tags": ["delivery", "handoff", "manual", "refund", "sop"], "tenant_id": "tenant-a", "text": "签收争议包括系统显示已签收但客户未收到、门卫代收未通知、快递柜超时退回、承运商误投。 坐席不能仅凭客户描述直接判定丢件，需要收集地址、联系电话和签收截图。", "title": "争议类型"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "2eee47e0797519140ab568d3217671daf0eed0f071fc89f0e995176fac999c93", "chunk_id": "tenant-a/lost_package_sop.md:chunk:1:0", "doc_id": "tenant-a/lost_package_sop.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-a/lost_package_sop.md:section:1", "section_path": ["Tenant A 丢件与签收争议 SOP", "处理流程"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-a/lost_package_sop.md", "tags": ["delivery", "handoff", "manual", "refund", "sop"], "tenant_id": "tenant-a", "text": "坐席先发起承运商核查，要求提供签收凭证和投递位置。 若承运商确认误投或丢件，可创建补发或退款工单。 若承运商提供有效签收凭证，但客户仍否认收货，应升级主管复核。", "title": "处理流程"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "6f5c712d4fbb5d23514d6c9b352163035706d4b3b4859ea58978effe2b08c02a", "chunk_id": "tenant-a/lost_package_sop.md:chunk:2:0", "doc_id": "tenant-a/lost_package_sop.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-a/lost_package_sop.md:section:2", "section_path": ["Tenant A 丢件与签收争议 SOP", "时效与话术"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-a/lost_package_sop.md", "tags": ["delivery", "handoff", "manual", "refund", "sop"], "tenant_id": "tenant-a", "text": "承运商核查通常需要 1 到 3 个工作日。 坐席应说明核查时效和下一步动作，不得在核查前承诺补发、退款或赔偿。", "title": "时效与话术"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "cc85b5447638e42b72227c94d9066a2de6593aaba4cf7f517c3f7d0f6d3985d2", "chunk_id": "tenant-a/preorder_policy.md:chunk:0:0", "doc_id": "tenant-a/preorder_policy.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-a/preorder_policy.md:section:0", "section_path": ["Tenant A 预售订单与取消规则", "预售说明"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-a/preorder_policy.md", "tags": ["manual", "refund"], "tenant_id": "tenant-a", "text": "预售商品页面会标注预计发货时间、定金规则和尾款支付窗口。 客户支付定金后，若未在规定时间内支付尾款，订单可能自动关闭。", "title": "预售说明"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "796bd9572008cba72dfbc0914dc49f08d170be7d32597f661f9a1ae36a398cd6", "chunk_id": "tenant-a/preorder_policy.md:chunk:1:0", "doc_id": "tenant-a/preorder_policy.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-a/preorder_policy.md:section:1", "section_path": ["Tenant A 预售订单与取消规则", "取消规则"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-a/preorder_policy.md", "tags": ["manual", "refund"], "tenant_id": "tenant-a", "text": "未支付尾款前，客户可申请取消预售订单，但定金是否可退以页面规则为准。 平台原因导致发货延迟超过公告时间 7 天以上，客户可申请取消并进入退款审核。", "title": "取消规则"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "d12c7421bd47d147e93f49f71c6df1ce4a617aced2152cc455b3761012a510ce", "chunk_id": "tenant-a/preorder_policy.md:chunk:2:0", "doc_id": "tenant-a/preorder_policy.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-a/preorder_policy.md:section:2", "section_path": ["Tenant A 预售订单与取消规则", "坐席要求"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-a/preorder_policy.md", "tags": ["manual", "refund"], "tenant_id": "tenant-a", "text": "坐席应核对商品页面快照、订单支付状态和公告记录。 不得口头承诺提前发货，也不得覆盖页面明确展示的定金规则。", "title": "坐席要求"}
