{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "7c866ffeeccd7b4550e281e35f2247e45b021659e562e6b84c8825f8c3b358c9", "chunk_id": "tenant-a/refund_policy.md:chunk:1:0", "doc_id": "tenant-a/refund_policy.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-a/refund_policy.md:section:1", "section_path": ["Tenant A 数码商品退货退款政策", "标准规则"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-a/refund_policy.md", "tags": ["delivery", "manual", "refund", "warranty"], "tenant_id": "tenant-a", "text": "签收 7 天内且商品未使用、包装完整、配件齐全时，客户可以申请无理由退货退款。 若商品存在质量问题，即使超过 7 天，也不能直接承诺退款，坐席需要先创建质检工单并上传照片、故障描述和订单号。 签收超过 7 天的普通不喜欢、不想要、买错型号，默认进入人工审核。", "title": "标准规则"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "df24a7dc3a25f869bdfcab06e7832f8324231efde7df76be3002e57e0f761cc4", "chunk_id": "tenant-a/refund_policy.md:chunk:2:0", "doc_id": "tenant-a/refund_policy.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-a/refund_policy.md:section:2", "section_path": ["Tenant A 数码商品退货退款政策", "例外条件"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-a/refund_policy.md", "tags": ["delivery", "manual", "refund", "warranty"], "tenant_id": "tenant-a", "text": "耳机、贴身穿戴设备拆封后涉及卫生风险，除质量问题外不支持无理由退货。 定制刻字、企业批量采购、赠品缺失、序列号不一致都需要人工审核。 坐席不得承诺“必退”或“立即到账”，只能说明审核路径和预计处理时间。", "title": "例外条件"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "52a08d5746a28105bad2e134411963615afcfc296866355f8a80bc7d37d2b55f", "chunk_id": "tenant-a/warranty_policy.md:chunk:0:0", "doc_id": "tenant-a/warranty_policy.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-a/warranty_policy.md:section:0", "section_path": ["Tenant A 保修与质量检测政策", "保修范围"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-a/warranty_policy.md", "tags": ["delivery", "manual", "refund", "warranty"], "tenant_id": "tenant-a", "text": "Tenant A 自营数码商品默认提供 12 个月有限保修。 保修覆盖非人为硬件故障，例如无法开机、按键失灵、显示异常、蓝牙连接失败。 保修不覆盖进水、摔落、私拆、非官方配件导致的损坏。", "title": "保修范围"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "6aa64111c428fe32c4702dd3321a9cf31c33dc11df4c01830fa72a10d439d0cb", "chunk_id": "tenant-a/warranty_policy.md:chunk:1:0", "doc_id": "tenant-a/warranty_policy.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-a/warranty_policy.md:section:1", "section_path": ["Tenant A 保修与质量检测政策", "检测要求"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-a/warranty_policy.md", "tags": ["delivery", "manual", "refund", "warranty"], "tenant_id": "tenant-a", "text": "客户主张质量问题时，需要提供订单号、故障视频或照片、商品序列号。 坐席应创建质检工单，不得直接判断责任归属。 检测结果为非人为故障时，可进入维修、换货或退款评估。", "title": "检测要求"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "6423f29767c38a51fade12ba396a5862c9d8f70b9e3ab67eb5d559f4aed30156", "chunk_id": "tenant-a/warranty_policy.md:chunk:2:0", "doc_id": "tenant-a/warranty_policy.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-a/warranty_policy.md:section:2", "section_path": ["Tenant A 保修与质量检测政策", "与退款关系"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-a/warranty_policy.md", "tags": ["delivery", "manual", "refund", "warranty"], "tenant_id": "tenant-a", "text": "签收 7 天内出现质量问题，可结合退款政策处理。 超过 7 天但在保修期内，优先维修或换货；是否退款需要主管审核。", "title": "与退款关系"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "58d4f71b27b49487d4671efa7e1da8b5ff66a3df701120db4a2ed81e8091602a", "chunk_id": "tenant-b/address_change_policy.md:chunk:0:0", "doc_id": "tenant-b/address_change_policy.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-b/address_change_policy.md:section:0", "section_path": ["Tenant B 地址修改与截单规则", "可修改阶段"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-b/address_change_policy.md", "tags": ["manual"], "tenant_id": "tenant-b", "text": "订单未出库前可以申请修改地址。 海外仓已出库、国际运输中或清关中时通常无法修改地址。 本地派送阶段可尝试联系承运商，但不保证成功。", "title": "可修改阶段"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "640ac3cab119398f3a94312a00658c39b4036ccfc549be0a5961d0a31c9a623d", "chunk_id": "tenant-b/address_change_policy.md:chunk:1:0", "doc_id": "tenant-b/address_change_policy.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-b/address_change_policy.md:section:1", "section_path": ["Tenant B 地址修改与截单规则", "坐席流程"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-b/address_change_policy.md", "tags": ["manual"], "tenant_id": "tenant-b", "text": "坐席应先查询订单履约阶段，再判断是否可截单。 若仓库已锁单，坐席只能提交截单请求，不能保证一定成功。", "title": "坐席流程"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "927eb8f3f0704227e85d29042d99b351bc13d3ff78a42b3c688c499c04a73c4f", "chunk_id": "tenant-b/address_change_policy.md:chunk:2:0", "doc_id": "tenant-b/address_change_policy.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-b/address_change_policy.md:section:2", "section_path": ["Tenant B 地址修改与截单规则", "风险提示"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-b/address_change_policy.md", "tags": ["manual"], "tenant_id": "tenant-b", "text": "客户因自行填写错误地址导致派送失败，可能需要承担二次派送或退回费用。 平台原因导致地址错误时，应升级履约团队处理。", "title": "风险提示"}
