{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "a07f2a062d9185f6efaadfe332938dccf6dc5f741a7745dd8154956f022f0ace", "chunk_id": "tenant-b/custom_home_goods_policy.md:chunk:1:0", "doc_id": "tenant-b/custom_home_goods_policy.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-b/custom_home_goods_policy.md:section:1", "section_path": ["Tenant B 定制家居商品政策", "取消与退货"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-b/custom_home_goods_policy.md", "tags": ["manual", "refund"], "tenant_id": "tenant-b", "text": "生产前可申请取消，是否产生费用取决于供应商状态。 进入生产后，除质量问题或平台生产错误外，不支持无理由退货。 客户提供错误尺寸导致无法安装，不属于平台责任。", "title": "取消与退货"}
