{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "ea642d74a0a387364faff795485fe6069b0707a5154ec59ba84db58eba9e60f9", "chunk_id": "tenant-internal/rag_evaluation_guideline.md:chunk:0:0", "doc_id": "tenant-internal/rag_evaluation_guideline.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-internal/rag_evaluation_guideline.md:section:0", "section_path": ["内部 SOP RAG 评估指标说明", "检索指标"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-internal/rag_evaluation_guideline.md", "tags": ["handoff", "manual", "sop"], "tenant_id": "tenant-internal", "text": "Context Recall 衡量标准答案所需证据是否出现在召回上下文中。 Tenant Leak Count 衡量是否召回了其他租户资料。 Retrieval Latency 用于控制坐席体验。", "title": "检索指标"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "f0145a157c5a532ecde78c09b08e9f9fb6217428d3e88093289ad5e4db484072", "chunk_id": "tenant-internal/rag_evaluation_guideline.md:chunk:1:0", "doc_id": "tenant-internal/rag_evaluation_guideline.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-internal/rag_evaluation_guideline.md:section:1", "section_path": ["内部 SOP RAG 评估指标说明", "生成指标"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-internal/rag_evaluation_guideline.md", "tags": ["handoff", "manual", "sop"], "tenant_id": "tenant-internal", "text": "Faithfulness 衡量回答是否被上下文支持。 Citation Coverage 衡量关键结论是否带引用。 Hallucination Risk 在证据不足或回答越过证据时升高。", "title": "生成指标"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "40528a6bfad163e49cb4788226708623ce5ad2ef9b6888294cd8de0c04e38bdb", "chunk_id": "tenant-internal/rag_evaluation_guideline.md:chunk:2:0", "doc_id": "tenant-internal/rag_evaluation_guideline.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-internal/rag_evaluation_guideline.md:section:2", "section_path": ["内部 SOP RAG 评估指标说明", "业务指标"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-internal/rag_evaluation_guideline.md", "tags": ["handoff", "manual", "sop"], "tenant_id": "tenant-internal", "text": "首轮解决率、转人工率、坐席采纳率、坐席修改率和未命中问题沉淀，是判断系统是否可运营的核心指标。", "title": "业务指标"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "aee3c2a46f8494e8a6e15767951e36fae853ed1c21578ed760e1e00cf68489c0", "chunk_id": "tenant-internal/tenant_isolation_policy.md:chunk:0:0", "doc_id": "tenant-internal/tenant_isolation_policy.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-internal/tenant_isolation_policy.md:section:0", "section_path": ["内部 SOP 多租户知识隔离规则", "基本原则"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-internal/tenant_isolation_policy.md", "tags": ["billing", "manual", "refund", "sop"], "tenant_id": "tenant-internal", "text": "每条知识、chunk、评估问题和回答 trace 必须带 tenant_id。 检索时必须先做租户过滤，再做向量或 BM25 召回。 内部 SOP 可以被授权坐席使用，但不能泄露给客户。", "title": "基本原则"}
{"acl_tags": ["support"], "checksum": "e77e39a99ca623abd3306ad0a3d1dd37fbf0c81661fa671ccc42c62067fef654", "chunk_id": "tenant-internal/tenant_isolation_policy.md:chunk:1:0", "doc_id": "tenant-internal/tenant_isolation_policy.md", "effective_from": "2026-01-01", "effective_to": null, "parent_id": "tenant-internal/tenant_isolation_policy.md:section:1", "section_path": ["内部 SOP 多租户知识隔离规则", "风险场景"], "source_uri": "dataset://contactflow_demo_kb_v0.2/tenant-internal/tenant_isolation_policy.md", "tags": ["billing", "manual", "refund", "sop"], "tenant_id": "tenant-internal", "text": "Tenant A 的 7 天数码退款政策不能回答 Tenant B 的跨境服饰 30 天退货问题。 Tenant B 的税费规则不能回答 Tenant A 的国内数码订单。 跨租户命中应计为严重检索错误。", "title": "风险场景"}
